     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 15pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.63in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中一直秉承“存古开新，兼容并包”的治校理念，着眼于培养未来的“新工科”类高层次科技人才，关注学生的全面发展，尤其注重学科竞赛拔尖人才的培养。在</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">202</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年全国中学生生物学联赛中，我校共有</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">位同学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">获奖：高二（6）班金易楠同学获一等奖，高二（9）班寿宇珂同学获二等奖。向获奖同学和竞赛教练范捷老师、杨琼老师表示祝贺！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">            </span></p><table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;"><tbody><tr class="firstRow"><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 58.05pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高二（6）</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 43.8pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">金易楠</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 48.2pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一等</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 60.45pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">镜湖校区</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 58.05pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高二（9）</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: windowtext; padding: 0px 5.4pt; vertical-align: top; width: 43.8pt; word-break: break-all;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">寿宇珂</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 48.2pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二等</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 60.45pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">镜湖校区</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> <img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/6/202606291041440560.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202606291041440560.png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                         </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">          </span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2026\6\202606291041176659.Jpeg" style="width: 4.755556in; height: 2.323611in" alt="202606291041176124.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对于一等奖获得者金易楠同学而言，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">显微镜下的细胞分裂，是生命律动的舞蹈；复杂的遗传图谱，是自然书写的诗篇。这是对他无数个日夜潜心钻研、反复求证的最高褒奖，更是对他那份“格物致知”科学精神的完美注脚。更难能可贵的是，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">并未将目光局限于书本与考题。他带着对生命科学的深刻理解，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">也曾参加</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全国青少年水科技发明比赛，并在这一更高、更广的舞台上，摘得</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全国</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一等奖！这不仅是一次跨学科的勇敢挑战，更是一份沉甸甸的社会责任。在这两项</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">富有挑战性的</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">赛事</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中获奖</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，靠的不是天赋，是超乎常人的自律、百折不挠的韧性，以及敢于跳出舒适圈的勇气。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">这</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">些</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">荣誉</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的背后，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">镌刻着</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">范捷老师、杨琼老师</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的智慧与汗水</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">她们</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">用匠心守望初心，用热爱点燃热爱</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">她们</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">是学生科学道路上最坚实的后盾，也是这趟摘星之旅中最温暖的航标</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #0F1115;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">期待更多一中学子怀揣对科学的好奇与敬畏，在探索未知的征途上大胆质疑、小心求证，将个人志趣融入国家科技发展的洪流。</span></p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
